[ceiling] These flat roofs connect the fore and aft ends of the two rounded cartridge grips. The hands push and pull on the Y-facing walls. Each roof's flat underside spans 18 by 15 mm and joins the surrounding cartridge body. Removable support leaves through the open side pockets before the pumps are installed.
